    "title": {
      "en": "Writing Post-Trade Analysis that Separates Process from Outcome",
      "zh": "撰写区分过程与结果的交易后分析"
    },
    "shortTitle": {
      "en": "post-trade analysis",
      "zh": "撰写区分过程与结果的交易后分析"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates writing post-trade analysis that separates process from outcome using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示撰写区分过程与结果的交易后分析。"
    },
