        "Explain the core decision rules behind writing post-trade analysis that separates process from outcome.",
        "Apply writing post-trade analysis that separates process from outcome to chart evidence without promising a trading outcome.",
        "Document invalidation and risk controls before demonstrating the skill."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "解释撰写区分过程与结果的交易后分析背后的核心决策规则。",
        "将撰写区分过程与结果的交易后分析应用于图表证据，同时不承诺交易结果。",
        "在展示技能前记录失效条件与风险控制。"
      ]
    },
