      "order": 5,
      "type": "practical_demonstration",
      "title": {
        "en": "Practical Demonstration: post-trade analysis",
        "zh": "实践展示：撰写区分过程与结果的交易后分析"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Using a demo account, TradingView, FXReplay, MT5 demo or another approved charting platform, demonstrate writing post-trade analysis that separates process from outcome. Annotate the evidence, entry condition, invalidation, stop loss, take profit and risk control, then explain why the demonstration follows the written rules.",
        "zh": "使用模拟账户、TradingView、FXReplay、MT5模拟版或其他获准图表平台展示撰写区分过程与结果的交易后分析。标注证据、入场条件、失效条件、止损、止盈与风险控制，并解释该展示为何符合书面规则。"
      },
      "instructions": {
